### Task 1.14: Binary Scene Format (.fcs)

**Format Spec**:
```
FCS File Format v1.0
====================

Header (64 bytes):
- Magic: "FCS\0" (4 bytes)
- Version: uint32 (4 bytes)
- Palette offset: uint64 (8 bytes)
- Texture offset: uint64 (8 bytes)
- Mesh offset: uint64 (8 bytes)
- Scene offset: uint64 (8 bytes)
- Reserved: (36 bytes)

Palette Section:
- Color count: uint32 (4 bytes)
- Colors: RGB888 array (3 bytes each)

Texture Section:
- Texture count: uint32 (4 bytes)
- For each texture:
  - Width: uint16
  - Height: uint16
  - Format: uint8 (indexed)
  - Data length: uint32
  - Pixel data: uint8 array (palette indices)

Mesh Section:
- Mesh count: uint32
- For each mesh:
  - Vertex count: uint32
  - Index count: uint32
  - Vertex data: Vertex array
  - Index data: uint32 array
  - AABB: Vec3 min, Vec3 max

Scene Section:
- Entity count: uint32
- For each entity:
  - Component flags: uint32
  - Transform: Vec3 pos, Quat rot, Vec3 scale
  - Mesh index: uint32 (if has mesh renderer)
  - Material index: uint32
  - Collider data (if has collider)
  - Physics data (if has rigidbody)
